; FilledInZigZag_ChannelStack_10plus5Layers_0p6mm_Channel15p2mm_Obj68
; P1S / 0.2 mm nozzle / PETG; one fully mirrored filled-zigzag + channel assembly
; BASE layers 1-10: shape/settings from FilledIn_ZigZag_0p6mm_10Layers_Obj68_25mms_K0p55_Flow1p4.gcode; rigid X translation only
; Mirrored gap 0.900000 mm: left translated +0.78 mm, right -0.78 mm
; Individual base geometry and 0.6 mm same-side tip spacing are UNCHANGED
; CHANNEL layers 11-15: XY from channel1_kamm.gcode; full mirror added
; Channel uniform scale 0.963961170122; longest right-hand vertical is exactly 15.200000 mm
; Channel long vertical aligned with the filled inner-tip baseline; bottom endpoints aligned
; Layer height 0.06 mm; base top Z0.60; channel top Z0.90
; Nominal width 0.15 mm; flow 1.4; M900 K0.55 L1000 M10; nozzle 255 C; bed 70 C
; First layer 5 mm/s; all later layers 25 mm/s; XY purge line 20 mm/s
; Base fan schedule unchanged; added channel layers use PWM227; auxiliary fan off
; Channel has 7 deposition moves per side/layer (6 lines + 1 fitted arc), not 671 sampled moves
; Static validation only; physical printing remains unverified
; EXECUTABLE_BLOCK_START
